<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna use this
to train vigorously!</font>

134
00:08:22,560 --> 00:08:24,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you, Pervy Sage!</font>

135
00:08:31,030 --> 00:08:34,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The walls have ears...
paper doors have eyes...</font>

136
00:08:42,160 --> 00:08:44,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage's secret training methods...</font>

137
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:02,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}{"WILLPOWER"</b></font>

138
00:09:03,310 --> 00:09:04,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

139
00:09:04,890 --> 00:09:06,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pervy Sage!</font>

140
00:09:12,490 --> 00:09:13,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since I have been entrusted</font>

141
00:09:13,900 --> 00:09:16,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the great Village Hidden
in the Leaves that you built</font>

142
00:09:17,490 --> 00:09:22,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">no matter what danger might strike
it is my duty to protect it.</font>

143
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:26,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hokage sure has it tough, huh.</font>

144
00:09:27,750 --> 00:09:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, you really do.</font>

145
00:09:31,130 --> 00:09:33,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that you, Shizune?
Enter!</font>

146
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:39,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of these reports regarding
the village's internal affairs accumulated</font>

147
00:09:39,390 --> 00:09:42,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">because so many things
were happening in the Leaf Village.</font>

148
00:09:43,180 --> 00:09:45,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess the only thing to do
is start at the top.</font>

149
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:49,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Maximum Security Facility.</font>

150
00:09:49,770 --> 00:09:51,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did its name change?</font>

151
00:09:51,610 --> 00:09:53,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, in the past
it was called</font>

152
00:09:53,610 --> 00:09:56,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prison Specializing in
Capital Offenses Ninja.</font>

153
00:10:00,450 --> 00:10:02,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fortunately, because there
is a downward trend</font>

154
00:10:02,660 --> 00:10:05,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in felonies committed by Shinobi</font>

155
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:09,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">along with the downsizing of the facility
the name was changed as well.</font>

156
00:10:09,670 --> 00:10:11,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Incarcerated are murderers,</font>

157
00:10:11,540 --> 00:10:14,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">those who were involved in
leaking classified secrets and so on.</font>

158
00:10:14,420 --> 00:10:16,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They are all criminal Ninja...</font>

159
00:10:16,130 --> 00:10:18,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There haven't been any noticeable
disruptions in the past few years</font>

160
00:10:18,380 --> 00:10:20,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the facility has been
relatively stable.</font>

161
00:10:33,860 --> 00:10:35,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Food!
— Food!</font>

162
00:10:35,610 --> 00:10:37,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's finally time to eat
isn't it, an-chan!</font>

163
00:10:37,990 --> 00:10:41,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah! I'm so excited!</font>

164
00:10:41,950 --> 00:10:43,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Fujin! Raijin!</font>

165
00:10:43,950 --> 00:10:46,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't shut up
you're gonna go without dinner!</font>

166
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gimme a break! Those guys...</font>

167
00:10:56,420 --> 00:10:57,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You may pass!</font>

168
00:10:58,670 --> 00:10:59,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Wait!</font>

169
00:11:02,090 --> 00:11:03,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're hurt, aren't you?</font>

170
00:11:03,760 --> 00:11:05,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go to the dispensary later
and have that looked at.</font>

171
00:11:06,220 --> 00:11:07,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

172
00:11:09,390 --> 00:11:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right next!</font>

173
00:11:24,330 --> 00:11:26,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey, an-chan...</font>

174
00:11:26,410 --> 00:11:27,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

175
00:11:27,790 --> 00:11:33,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why is the little finger
short and weak?</font>

176
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:35,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's easy, Raijin.</font>

177
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:38,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the little finger was thick and strong</font>

178
00:11:38,300 --> 00:11:41,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then your thumb would
have no leg to stand on.</font>

179
00:11:41,340 --> 00:11:43,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I see!</font>

180
00:11:43,930 --> 00:11:46,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An-chan... An-chan...!</font>

181
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:47,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— A lizard!</font>

182
00:11:48,640 --> 00:11:51,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raijin, you've always been
a dandy one from way back.</font>

183
00:11:55,980 --> 00:11:57,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-We haven't had enough to eat
have we, an-chan?</font>

184
00:11:58,110 --> 00:11:58,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

185
00:12:17,420 --> 00:12:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not asking permission again...</font>

186
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:20,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's the matter?</font>

187
00:12:20,170 --> 00:12:21,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's up this time?</font>

188
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm starving...</font>

189
00:12:23,930 --> 00:12:25,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">G-Give us something to eat!</font>

190
00:12:26,050 --> 00:12:30,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no... If these guys find out
I don't have anything...!</font>

191
00:12:30,310 --> 00:12:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... right now...</font>

192
00:12:36,980 --> 00:12:41,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell me that
you don't have even one offering...</font>

193
00:12:41,900 --> 00:12:45,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to these Fujin and
Raijin brothers?!</font>

194
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:47,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... wait... wait...!</font>

195
00:12:53,830 --> 00:12:55,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you think? Tastes good, huh?</font>

196
00:12:57,750 --> 00:12:59,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll bring you something else later!</font>

197
00:13:00,800 --> 00:13:02,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right now, make do with that!</font>

198
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:04,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Okay!
— Okay!</font>

199
00:13:07,430 --> 00:13:08,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?</font>

200
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:14,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those guys are quiet
when they have food.</font>

201
00:13:15,140 --> 00:13:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But if they get angry
they're out of control.</font>

202
00:13:17,860 --> 00:13:23,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... They annihilated all their comrades
over food during a mission</font>

203
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:26,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the people around just barely
managed to hold them down.</font>

204
00:13:36,830 --> 00:13:38,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Something smells good?!</font>

205
00:13:39,880 --> 00:13:40,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

206
00:13:43,010 --> 00:13:43,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This way!</font>

207
00:13:44,170 --> 00:13:47,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Food! Food! Food!
— Food! Food! Food!</font>

208
00:13:54,770 --> 00:13:57,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I just can't get to liking clerical work.</font>

209
00:13:57,940 --> 00:14:00,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's still a whole lot more to do,
Tsunade-sama.</font>

210
00:14:06,860 --> 00:14:07,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder what this is?</font>

211
00:14:08,030 --> 00:14:10,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like a formula
for some kind of medicine...</font>

212
00:14:11,740 --> 00:14:12,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A formula...</font>

213
00:14:15,870 --> 00:14:18,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Send an available Jonin here
immediately!</font>

214
00:14:19,170 --> 00:14:20,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes ma'am?</font>

215
00:14:20,630 --> 00:14:21,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry!</font>

216
00:14:21,540 --> 00:14:22,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes ma'am!</font>

217
00:14:46,530 --> 00:14:48,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about it...
Does it taste good?</font>

218
00:14:49,610 --> 00:14:52,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... I see...
There's still a whole lot more.</font>

219
00:14:53,580 --> 00:14:54,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just as I thought</font>

220
00:14:54,540 --> 00:14:57,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that good smell was coming
from your place, aniki!</font>

221
00:14:57,500 --> 00:15:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh yeah...'Cause aniki
always has delicious food!</font>

222
00:15:02,500 --> 00:15:06,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was worth sneaking, wasn't it?</font>

223
00:15:07,420 --> 00:15:11,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">'Cause I'd feel so sorry
if you guys had to go hungry.</font>

224
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:13,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aniki...</font>

225
00:15:15,390 --> 00:15:16,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— A lizard!
— A lizard!</font>

226
00:15:18,180 --> 00:15:20,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, I see... Happy?</font>

227
00:15:21,730 --> 00:15:23,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How about it, you guys?</font>

228
00:15:23,810 --> 00:15:26,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you want to eat things
that are even more delicious?</font>

229
00:15:27,900 --> 00:15:30,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Where are they at?!</font>

230
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:35,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we go to the place where
an old friend of mine is...</font>

231
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:39,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you can pig out on food
that's even more delicious than here.</font>

232
00:15:41,250 --> 00:15:45,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that the guy you told us
about long time ago, aniki?</font>

233
00:15:50,630 --> 00:15:53,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, Orochimaru-sama...</font>

234
00:15:56,930 --> 00:15:59,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gimme a break...
that guy's gotta be kidding!</font>

235
00:16:00,890 --> 00:16:02,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Pervy Sage...</font>

236
00:16:02,390 --> 00:16:04,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">just leaving me and
my training up in the air!</font>

237
00:16:04,150 --> 00:16:06,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come on don't say that, Naruto.</font>

238
00:16:06,900 --> 00:16:08,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya-sama had a mission too.</font>

239
00:16:09,070 --> 00:16:09,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh!</font>

240
00:16:10,110 --> 00:16:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's probably that
Tsunade-sama decided</font>

241
00:16:12,820 --> 00:16:15,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that only Jiraiya-sama
could do the job...</font>

242
00:16:15,410 --> 00:16:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped.</font>

243
00:16:17,330 --> 00:16:20,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! So it was Grandma Tsunade's
doing after all, huh!</font>

244
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:26,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, I guess all I can do is treat you
to some ramen noodles like this.</font>

245
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:28,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So cheer up.</font>

246
00:16:32,800 --> 00:16:36,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna go complain
to Grandma Tsunade!</font>

247
00:16:38,100 --> 00:16:40,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for the meal, Iruka-sensei!</font>

248
00:16:40,430 --> 00:16:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Naruto!</font>

249
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:53,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... another annoying situation.</font>

250
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:07,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? The Maximum Security Facility?!</font>

251
00:17:09,460 --> 00:17:11,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is about a year ago</font>

252
00:17:11,630 --> 00:17:14,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a Chunin Academy staff member
used Naruto</font>

253
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:18,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to sneak out
the Scroll of Sealing.</font>

254
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:21,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">According to the report it was
a crime committed by Mizuki acting alone.</font>

255
00:17:21,890 --> 00:17:24,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The crime was solved but...?</font>

256
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, if it really was him acting alone.</font>

257
00:17:29,020 --> 00:17:34,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The possibility has arisen that
a bigger mastermind is behind this crime.</font>

258
00:17:35,780 --> 00:17:37,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a clue...</font>

259
00:17:38,370 --> 00:17:40,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is something that Mizuki
was concealing</font>

260
00:17:40,280 --> 00:17:44,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when he was incarcerated
in the Maximum Security Facility.</font>

261
00:17:44,870 --> 00:17:48,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the time nobody thought of it
as anything more than a doodle.</font>

262
00:17:48,630 --> 00:17:50,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama, what is that anyway?</font>

263
00:17:51,250 --> 00:17:53,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know, however...</font>

264
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:56,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The handwriting resembles
the document confiscated from the facility</font>

265
00:17:56,630 --> 00:18:00,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">where Orochimaru was conducting
human experiments...</font>

266
00:18:01,640 --> 00:18:04,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which means that...
Orochimaru is connected to this crime?!</font>

267
00:18:05,180 --> 00:18:06,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The possibility of that is not zero.</font>

268
00:18:08,150 --> 00:18:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not like a Chunin alone could do
anything with the Scroll of Sealing.</font>

269
00:18:14,940 --> 00:18:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would only make sense if Orochimaru
were pulling strings from behind.</font>

270
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:24,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Asuma! Kurenai!</font>

271
00:18:24,700 --> 00:18:29,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go immediately to the Maximum
Security Facility and interrogate Mizuki!</font>

272
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru?!</font>

273
00:19:00,570 --> 00:19:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful! Something's strange here!</font>

274
00:19:02,820 --> 00:19:05,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... It's too quiet.</font>

275
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:07,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

276
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:17,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, how touching.
A welcome party for us...</font>

277
00:19:17,130 --> 00:19:20,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... we're giving you a big welcome.
Right, an-chan?</font>

278
00:19:20,930 --> 00:19:21,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

279
00:19:28,020 --> 00:19:30,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Asuma, don't tell me that
those guys are...</font>

280
00:19:31,190 --> 00:19:34,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh huh... The legendary idiot brothers...</font>

281
00:19:35,190 --> 00:19:36,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fujin and Raijin!</font>

282
00:19:43,490 --> 00:19:44,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Asuma...</font>

283
00:19:49,500 --> 00:19:52,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you guys are whooping it up
too much for a welcome party!</font>

284
00:19:53,920 --> 00:19:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, calm down...
the welcome party's just started.</font>

285
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:14,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His character has changed completely...</font>

286
00:20:16,360 --> 00:20:18,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All you jerks...</font>

287
00:20:18,360 --> 00:20:21,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will... be our offering!</font>

288
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:25,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it!</font>

289
00:20:32,540 --> 00:20:33,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru!</font>

290
00:21:00,320 --> 00:21:03,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Asuma-sensei... Kurenai-sensei!</font>

291
00:21:14,890 --> 00:21:19,180
